    {"take": "02.wav", "clip": 2, "start": 0.15, "phrases": [[0.0, 0.45, "Watch."], [1.5, 4.39, "A fresh drop dries fastest at the edge."], [4.98, 6.85, "But the edge is stuck to the saucer,"], [7.57, 9.14, "so it can't shrink inward."]]},
